Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:00:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if everything's going a bit too fast now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Very ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You once gave me a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked me to give it back if you got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that point has been reached.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll consider checking yourself in,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,because you're not well anymore.
